OL,3,GNEWSAFamily's plea after autistic son
OL,4,Aescapes school
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of a severely autistic boy
OL,7,Fwho escaped from school for 25 minutes
OL,8,Fhas urged people to be more aware of
OL,9,Fvulnerable people.
OL,11,FJamie, 7, who is non-verbal and has
OL,12,Fepilepsy, scaled a tree before ending
OL,13,Fup in a park behind Brooke School in
OL,14,FRugby, Warwickshire, despite close
OL,15,Fsupervision and security measures being
OL,16,Fin place.
OL,18,F"Please ask a question and make that
OL,19,Fphone call because a vulnerable person
OL,20,Fcould be in severe danger, and it could
OL,21,Fsave a life," his stepmother Carly
OL,22,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,354,350,200,160,0,100
