OL,3,GNEWSAFamily's plea after autistic son
OL,4,Aescapes school
OL,5,
OL,6,FHeadteacher Greg Williams said the
OL,7,Fschool for children with special
OL,8,Feducation needs "continually reviews"
OL,9,Fits procedures to "ensure the safety
OL,10,Fand welfare" of its pupils.
